===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|informal}} Something tasty; a [[delicious]] [[article]] of [[food]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2011|author=Nick Ardley|title=The Jottings of a Thames Estuary Ditch-Crawler
|passage=The mate had procured other '''tasties''' too, olives and such, for later in the evening.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2017|author=Susan M. Hall|title=My Vanishing African Dreams
|passage=Sean then made up the most delicious pâté to have with biscuits and various other '''tasties'''.}}
# {{lb|en|Philippines|dated}} A [[loaf]] of [[bread]].

